
    +--------------------------------------------------------------------+
    |                N I M   C o m m a n d s   M e n u                   | ##
    +--------------------------------------------------------------------+ ##
    |                                                                    | ##
    |     <P>lay a game  (Shows the ones it is your turn in & so on)     | ##
    |     <J>oin a game  (That is waiting on another player)             | ##
    |     <B>egin a game (Commence a NEW game with only you in it)       | ##
    |     <S>tatus       (Displays games won, in progress or waiting)    | ##
    |     <Y>our games   (As above, but only games which you are in)     | ##
    |     <V>iew a game  (Check out ANY game in progress)                | ##
    |     <I>nstructions (How to play Nim!)                              | ##
    |     <A>bout        (Some credits, and so on)                       | ##
    |     <C>hange Setup (Toggle ANSI and IBM graphics)                  | ##
    |     <M>aintenance  (For sysop only! I mean it!)                    | ##
    |     <Q>uit         (Hardly needs explanation, eh?)                 | ##
    |     <?>=Menu       (Prints this very screen up for you)            | ##
    +--------------------------------------------------------------------+ ##
      #######################################################################

